(7504396, 1196046, 33392, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> Magnolia. a stellata, I think. (Stick with me and mefnj. Or maybe that would be 3 sticks).<br/> <br/>I think it is lovely. I spend a lot of time with my M Iolanthe. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>OK - now that I have looked up stellata, I agree.  I was only familiar with the Southern Magnolia, which looks incredibly different.  Thank you for the guidance.  Learn something new every day.</td>', 'Originally posted by tnun: Magnolia. a stellata, I think. (Stick with me and mefnj. Or maybe that would be 3 sticks). I think it is lovely. I spend a lot of time with my M Iolanthe.   OK - now that I have looked up stellata, I agree.  I was only familiar with the Southern Magnolia, which looks incredibly different.  Thank you for the guidance.  Learn something new every day.', '2017-03-08 09:08:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504405, 1195977, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that makes a significant contribution to the challenge.<br/> <br/>Indeed Drake, you are right it fits the challenge brief perfectly. The foreground bird is nice and sharply captured with lovely balance provided by the background soft focus bird, I like the way their wings are interlocking it makes for a lovely composition. The only minor criticism is the amount of empty sky above them I think if you cropped nearer to the tops of the birds it would improve the overall result.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that makes a significant contribution to the challenge. Indeed Drake, you are right it fits the challenge brief perfectly. The foreground bird is nice and sharply captured with lovely balance provided by the background soft focus bird, I like the way their wings are interlocking it makes for a lovely composition. The only minor criticism is the amount of empty sky above them I think if you cropped nearer to the tops of the birds it would improve the overall result.', '2017-03-08 09:53:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504411, 1196179, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that makes a significant contribution to the challenge.<br/> <br/>A lovely image Luana. I like your composition and crop with the sharp stamens on the hotspot and the shallow DOF youve opted for with maximum aperture. The white background provides the high key aspect without any distraction to contend with its all working very well. The lighting is good too. I like the greenness of the stalk it provides a nice balance with those dominant reds. All in all Luana its a masterful job that Im surprised didnt score higher, well done.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that makes a significant contribution to the challenge. A lovely image Luana. I like your composition and crop with the sharp stamens on the hotspot and the shallow DOF youve opted for with maximum aperture. The white background provides the high key aspect without any distraction to contend with its all working very well. The lighting is good too. I like the greenness of the stalk it provides a nice balance with those dominant reds. All in all Luana its a masterful job that Im surprised didnt score higher, well done.', '2017-03-08 10:38:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504419, 1196012, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that makes a significant contribution to the challenge.<br/> <br/>Elegant being a most appropriate title Gin Tay, a lovely image. The composition is lovely with the strong base at bottom left and that lovely sinuous stalk reaching up in to the frame topped by the gorgeous yellows of the petals. I love the pastel shades and the lighting sets it all off really well. The soft focus background is nicely done too with just enough and not too much detail to detract from the flower itself, a lovely job well done.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that makes a significant contribution to the challenge. Elegant being a most appropriate title Gin Tay, a lovely image. The composition is lovely with the strong base at bottom left and that lovely sinuous stalk reaching up in to the frame topped by the gorgeous yellows of the petals. I love the pastel shades and the lighting sets it all off really well. The soft focus background is nicely done too with just enough and not too much detail to detract from the flower itself, a lovely job well done.', '2017-03-08 11:08:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504422, 1196224, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that makes a contribution to the challenge.<br/> <br/>Well Susie, youve certainly got soft focus and high key to meet the challenge brief but its not quite working. They elements have no cohesiveness there is no focal point against a backdrop of uninteresting bland white sky, Im sorry but it just fails to hit the spot. I do like the curve in the road, though Id probably have cropped the left corner out. I think perhaps a panoramic with much less sky and a slower shutter speed with correct focus but softness created through motion blur from a slower shutter speed may have worked better. Sorry Susie, better luck next time.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that makes a contribution to the challenge. Well Susie, youve certainly got soft focus and high key to meet the challenge brief but its not quite working. They elements have no cohesiveness there is no focal point against a backdrop of uninteresting bland white sky, Im sorry but it just fails to hit the spot. I do like the curve in the road, though Id probably have cropped the left corner out. I think perhaps a panoramic with much less sky and a slower shutter speed with correct focus but softness created through motion blur from a slower shutter speed may have worked better. Sorry Susie, better luck next time.', '2017-03-08 11:22:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504473, 1196225, 112739, '<td valign="top">This was my highest rated image with a 9. Perfect title too!</td>', 'This was my highest rated image with a 9. Perfect title too!', '2017-03-08 16:00:15.000000', NULL, 0),
