(7504514, 1196012, 185714, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sidpixel:</b></div><hr/><i> Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that makes a significant contribution to the challenge.<br/> <br/>Elegant being a most appropriate title Gin Tay, a lovely image. The composition is lovely with the strong base at bottom left and that lovely sinuous stalk reaching up in to the frame topped by the gorgeous yellows of the petals. I love the pastel shades and the lighting sets it all off really well. The soft focus background is nicely done too with just enough and not too much detail to detract from the flower itself, a lovely job well done. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you for your time to review this image.  Appreciate very much your valuable comments.<br/> <br/>cheers<br/>Gin Tay</td>', 'Originally posted by sidpixel: Hello from the critique club An appealing image that makes a significant contribution to the challenge. Elegant being a most appropriate title Gin Tay, a lovely image. The composition is lovely with the strong base at bottom left and that lovely sinuous stalk reaching up in to the frame topped by the gorgeous yellows of the petals. I love the pastel shades and the lighting sets it all off really well. The soft focus background is nicely done too with just enough and not too much detail to detract from the flower itself, a lovely job well done.   Thank you for your time to review this image.  Appreciate very much your valuable comments. cheersGin Tay', '2017-03-08 21:46:02.000000', NULL, 0),
